error: a 'View' handle is a borrow — `place` copies the CONCRETE view into frame-arena storage, and an already-erased handle has nothing left to copy. Drop the erasure (`place(v)`, not `place(v.(View))`); a helper composes by returning what `place` returned, not its own erasure.
